        "text": "Nor I.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you know how to speak after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "A wandering singer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I know not what a wandering singer is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sheetmetal, do not speak to her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your face, unfamiliar. Your attire, strange. You are not one from here. What is your business?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to ask a question.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your clothes, very new.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you seen my fellow person?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You have much strength. You are able to eat your fill.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "She came here before I did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your case, very heavy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "An instrument is not a light thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The thing in your grasp, very uncanny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I assume your harps should come more or less the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Plucks strings)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ears, pained. It is a weapon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is able to not be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sheetmetal, this person, uncanny. Do not heed her. To speak, very tiring.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Bench. Let go of him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bench... Do you mean this child?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't intend anything for him. He took something of mine. Things like that are significant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You came to rob something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm only taking back what's mine. And looking for someone who can understand me when I talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Whimper*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Inhabitant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Our child, you may not touch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our things, you may not rob.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 50,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Our rules, may not be broken.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sheetmetal, you have gotten nearer. What are you doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She is going to harm our child, steal what is ours, break our rules.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is she not our sister? If she is, she too has a share.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She is surely not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't understand me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go and ask someone else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 100,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "You may not leave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_npc_178",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 100,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "One moment, Sheetmetal...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
